  "id": "hierarchy",
  "term": "hierarchy",
  "definition": "In cognition, a hierarchy is an ordered ranking in which some kinds of information receive stronger or faster attention than others. In the supplied context, it refers to visual attention being prioritized in the order of animals, then plants, then manufactured objects.",
